Metadata-Version: 2.4
Name: pca9685_arm_robot
Version: 0.1.0
Summary: ROS 2 package for complete_assembly — 5-DOF servo arm with parallel gripper (right_gear_joint + 5 mimic joints), driven by a PCA9685 over I2C (bus 7) on the Jetson AGX Orin. Includes hardware bridge (pca9685_i2c_node), pick_and_place, servo calibration, and RViz display launch.
Maintainer: Tashen
Maintainer-email: tashenlrana@gmail.com
License: Apache-2.0
Requires-Dist: setuptools
